Survey of `cli/cmd_pm_launch.oo` header versus the `--exec` body.
This note is process. It is not a second product.

## 1. Status

  Today `--exec` is partial.
  The gate is done.
  A real run of the pinned `.oo` is residual.
  This ship is open.

  Content-addressed store (CAS) is the pin directory
  `.ooda_modules/cas/<sha>`.
  The gate is `pm_launch_gate`. It checks yank, sha256, and extra caps.
  A pinned `.oo` is the locked payload file in that CAS directory.

